   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "家装参观：将日常用品变成展品",
   "texts": [
    "储物单元上展示着物品。",
    "<p>将日常用品变成精美展示品，供人欣赏，是一件充满乐趣的事。不妨从以下创意中获取灵感，用以想不到的独特方式展示你最爱的物品。</p>",
    "家装参观：将日常用品变成展品",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/85/3f/853ffbb5d8479eaf89da6de977d5e367.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/85/3f/853ffbb5d8479eaf89da6de977d5e367.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "楼梯间的墙壁上挂满了图片。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50301618"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/05/47/05476ba401f18af7007088f0d5765a81.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/05/47/05476ba401f18af7007088f0d5765a81.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>1.拼贴家庭照片&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>将难以利用的墙面空间利用起来，比如楼梯间。你可以在此看到，通过将三种不同尺寸的框架进行排列布局，便可让家庭回忆的剪影布满整面墙壁。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "玻璃储物柜中放着调料罐。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "00297464"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/44/79/44792c9b6687d1b1454f827dbc39d827.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/44/79/44792c9b6687d1b1454f827dbc39d827.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>2.大饱眼福&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>在这间开放式厨房里，带玻璃柜门的食品柜（复古风格的宜家储物柜）旁摆放着许多配方卡，便于你轻松挑选各类烹饪配料。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "砧板挂在厨房里的挂杆上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "00300348"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1b/8a/1b8aee6c41c4fe3644a4d37c51d3df5b.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/1b/8a/1b8aee6c41c4fe3644a4d37c51d3df5b.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>3.厨具展示&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>把砧板挂起来，既能节省空间，又能装点厨房。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "包挂在狗狗形状的挂钩上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10198430"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/33/8d/338d68eca9cd93202075f0b7ebb9107f.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/33/8d/338d68eca9cd93202075f0b7ebb9107f.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>4.享受细节带来的乐趣&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>哪怕在门厅，也可以增加一些有趣的细节。利用便利挂钩悬挂背包、外套和太阳镜，不仅方便拿取，还能令一切整齐有序。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "储物单元上展示着物品和杂志。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "90353686"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/23/ab/23ababbf039eb73f5661168fbf79542e.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/23/ab/23ababbf039eb73f5661168fbf79542e.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>5.打造充满个性的储物装置&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>定制专属的开放式储物装置。每一间壁室都可以变成迷你展示区，不妨设计一个主题，让所有独立单元构成一个统一的展示区。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "床边桌上摆放着书和灯具。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40146779"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/9f/66/9f660ea2c4ab5bb1e45b64937a22a49b.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/9f/66/9f660ea2c4ab5bb1e45b64937a22a49b.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>6.简约床边装饰风格&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>打造一个既美观又实用的展示空间。放上一摞书和一盏灯杆倾斜的灯具，营造深夜阅读的氛围。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "图片搁板上展示着艺术品和其他物品。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80257609"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/24/05/2405444abf0fd76364a119eb64b524c0.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/24/05/2405444abf0fd76364a119eb64b524c0.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>7.展示藏品&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>将形态各异的各类物品按颜色和形状分类摆放，确保整齐有序，打造出充满趣味的艺术墙。天然树枝和浮木与带图案的工艺品相映成趣，令人赏心悦目。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "配饰悬挂在梯子的挂钩上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "20176381"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/04/9d/049d7ba612953cc51616ee4c2cb5a791.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/04/9d/049d7ba612953cc51616ee4c2cb5a791.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>8.简易储物方案&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>设计个性储物装置。别样用途在这里你可以看到，卧室的墙壁上装有一个带有厨房专用挂钩的梯子，上面挂着衣服配饰。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
